            <p style="margin:0; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.62; color:#A6A39E; max-width:32em">Valor, condições e apontamentos são confirmados pelo canal oficial.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-step="" style="position:relative; display:flex; gap:22px; opacity:.45; transition:opacity 520ms ease">
          <span data-num="" style="flex:none; width:48px; height:48px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid rgba(243,239,228,.16); background:#0A0A0C; font-family:'Instrument Sans', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-stretch:75%; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:.1em; color:#A6A39E; transition:color 520ms ease, border-color 520ms ease">04</span>
          <div style="padding-top:6px">
            <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px; font-family:'Instrument Sans', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-stretch:75%; font-size:20px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.005em; text-transform:uppercase">Eu cuido do trajeto</h3>
            <p style="margin:0; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.62; color:#A6A39E; max-width:32em">O serviço acontece conforme o combinado, com comunicação e atenção ao contexto.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding:clamp(56px,7vw,108px) 0">
    <div style="max-width:1440px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 clamp(16px,3vw,40px)">
      <p style="margin:0 0 22px; font-family:'Instrument Sans', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-stretch:75%; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#C79C5B">Qualidade operacional</p>
      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr)); gap:clamp(20px,4vw,64px); align-items:start; margin-bottom:clamp(38px,4.5vw,64px)">
